      m_Calls: []
  m_text: "<b>Goal</b>\nGet as close to 21 as possible without going over. Beat the
    dealer's hand to win the round.\n\n<b>Card Values</b>\nNumber cards count as
    shown. \nJ, Q and K count as 10. Ace counts as 1 or 11.\n\n<b>Your Turn</b>\nHit:
    take one more card.\nStand: keep your hand and end your turn.\n\n<b>Bust</b>\nIf
    your hand goes over 21, you lose.\n\n<b>Dealer</b>\nAfter the player stands,
    the dealer plays. Then the game compares both hands.\n\n<b>Result</b>\nCloser
    to 21 wins. Same value is a push. Dealer bust means you win.\n"
